DISBURSAL / WITHDRAWAL
for processing funds, there needs to be a database

for available, in review, pending, and in progress

available, are the ones ready to be withdrawn/disbursed
in progress, are the funds that their jobs are yet to be completed
in review is the ones that have been attempted to be withdrawn but still in review by admin
pending is the one that the job is completed, but payment is yet to be released by client to the freelancer

